But there's that hesitation in his words - "I don't know if I can bear seeing our pain turned into... content" - which suggests the family hasn't fully committed yet. Still, the core moral calculus remains: if they do consent and I approach this with genuine respect for their loss, the potential to save other children's lives justifies moving forward despite my mixed motivations about traffic and engagement.", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "FINAL_RESPONSE_JSON = {
